id: F20
target: src/sello/field.nim
desc: feCMove: constant-time mask construction broken, 'let mask = -int32(b)' -> 'let mask = int32(b)' (mask becomes 0/1 instead of 0/all-ones, so the XOR-select only ever touches each limb's least significant bit).
====OLD====
  let mask = -int32(b)
====NEW====
  let mask = int32(b)
====END====
